X:1
T:Savior, Like A Shepherd Lead Us
T:BRADBURY
C:Music: William B. Bradbury, 1859 · Words: attr. Dorothy Ann Thrupp, 1836
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Golden Chain and Shower", 1866 Hymn 94. Ed. Wm. Bradbury. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/bradbury_bradbury): 100% of pitches and 98% of note lengths agree.
